  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Brand</strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><em><strong>+400 stores in Europe</strong></em><br>Hello Goodskin is the story of Claire and Elo&iuml;se. Two sisters, passionates, bubblies and close-knits. They are very active and work in the world of beauty.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">In 2019, one of them is struck down by illness and has to undergo numerous chemotherapy treatments. The inconveniences caused to her facial skin are numerous and painful (redness, flaking, tightness, intense dehydration).</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Being immersed in the world of beauty, she has the facility to test almost every product on the market without ever finding the miracle treatment!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Out of love for a loved one whom she couldn't bear to see suffer, her younger sister finally got her to try out a revolutionary facial cleansing brush.... with sonic vibrations.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">But the brush doesn't feel right in the hand, and its shape doesn't allow it to be used around the eyes, or on other more fragile and delicate areas... And the price isn't affordable for all women!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">In 2021, the two young women decided to turn this ordeal into a victory!</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong>All women deserve a beautiful skin</strong>, to maintain their femininity in all circumstances, even those with atypical backgrounds!</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; <strong>Product description</strong></p>\r\n<h5>A GLOWING SKIN IN 2 WEEKS &amp;&nbsp;IN JUST 3 MINUTES A DAY.<br><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The daily gesture for healthy skin,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">with CLEAN PULSE, clean your skin thoroughly and gently.</span></h5>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Its sonic vibration system with&nbsp;4 adjustable speeds&nbsp;acts in depth to eliminate: make-up residues, impurities, blackheads and dirt. It can be used underwater (waterproof) and is rechargeable, so it goes everywhere with you.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; <strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">2 essential elements for beautiful skin are sleep and perfectly clean skin</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For sublime skin and a more even complexion<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For smoother, soft skin<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- To reduce scars<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- To stimulate collagen and elastin production<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For plumper skin<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- To reduce fine lines and wrinkles<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For more luminous make-up<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For longer-lasting make-up<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For a redefined facial oval<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">- For a smoother, soothed and drained eye contour</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; <strong>Payment terms</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>You will get a 20% commission on total referral sales when a customer makes a purchase through your affiliate link or uses your coupon code.</strong></p>",
